1096:
PLC in programming mode\n
Description\Reason:\n
- Can't access the board due to\n
  the PLC in programming mode\n
  or the RIO is configured\n
  incorrectly.\n
\t\n
Check list:\n
1. PLC in programming mode\n
2. Check RIO configuration
1097:
Parameter store error\n
Description\Reason:\n
- Signal %s: This type of signal\n
 can't have store option.\n
\t\n
Check list:\n
1. Only digital signals can have store.
1098:
